{
  "id": "6acfcbf223a93dd7198a4445",
  "title": "一つの指輪",
  "created": 1792003062,
  "updated": 1792012099,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6acfcbf223a93dd7198a4445",
      "text": "一つの指輪",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1792003062,
      "updated": 1792003062
    },
    {
      "id": "6acfcbfd0000000000e7a557",
      "text": ">三つの指輪は、空の下なるエルフの王に、",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1792003069,
      "updated": 1792003185
    },
    {
      "id": "6acfcc710000000000e7a559",
      "text": ">　七つの指輪は、岩の館のドワーフの君に、",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1792003185,
      "updated": 1792012088
    },
    {
      "id": "6acfcc710000000000e7a55a",
      "text": ">九つは、死すべき運命の人の子に、",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1792003185,
      "updated": 1792012092
    },
    {
      "id": "6acfcc710000000000e7a55b",
      "text": ">　一つは、暗き御座の冥王のため、",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1792003185,
      "updated": 1792012099
    },
    {
      "id": "6acfcc710000000000e7a55c",
      "text": ">影横たわるモルドールの国に。",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1792003185,
      "updated": 1792003185
    },
    {
      "id": "6acfcc710000000000e7a55d",
      "text": ">　一つの指輪は、すべてを統べ、",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1792003185,
      "updated": 1792003185
    },
    {
      "id": "6acfcc710000000000e7a55e",
      "text": ">　一つの指輪は、すべてを見つけ、",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1792003185,
      "updated": 1792003185
    },
    {
      "id": "6acfcc710000000000e7a55f",
      "text": ">　一つの指輪は、すべてを捕えて、",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1792003185,
      "updated": 1792003185
    },
    {
      "id": "6acfcc710000000000e7a560",
      "text": ">　　くらやみのなかにつなぎとめる。",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1792003185,
      "updated": 1792003185
    },
    {
      "id": "6acfcc710000000000e7a561",
      "text": ">影横たわるモルドールの国に。",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1792003185,
      "updated": 1792003185
    },
    {
      "id": "6acfcbfd0000000000e7a558",
      "text": "https://arda.saloon.jp/?力の指輪の詩",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1792003069,
      "updated": 1792003263
